(1 About these standards) Tj T*
(This document sets out the service that Kestrel Valley Water gives to its customers in the) Tj T*
(Kestrel Valley supply area. It replaces the edition published in March 2019. The standards) Tj T*
(apply to residential and business customers alike unless a section says otherwise.) Tj T*
(Kestrel Valley Water now supplies drinking water to about 226,000 households and 9,400) Tj T*
(businesses.) Tj T*
