(Edition 2024. Published September 2024.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 Leaks and supply problems) Tj T*
(We SHALL attend reported leaks within 2 hours of the first report, day or night.) Tj T*
(Customers are given at least 72 hours notice of a planned outage.) Tj T*
(If an unplanned interruption lasts longer than 12 hours, we deliver bottled water to customers) Tj T*
(who ask for it.) Tj T*
(The emergency helpline answers calls within 120 seconds on average.) Tj T*
(Page 2) Tj T*
