(3 Meters and bills) Tj T*
(Meters are read every three months. Smart meters send a reading every day.) Tj T*
(Bills are issued four times a year.) Tj T*
(A reconnection charge of GBP 60 applies when a supply has been disconnected at the customer's) Tj T*
(request.) Tj T*
(Residential customers receive a water quality report every 12 months; business customers) Tj T*
(receive one every 6 months.) Tj T*
(Page 3) Tj T*
